  "description": "LiteDB backend for Durable ORM: store entities in an embedded single-file (or in-memory) LiteDB document database with the full IRepository surface, LINQ predicates pushed down to LiteDB indexes where the semantics match C#, exact value round-trips, includes, optimistic concurrency and async-safe transactions.",
