  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0: initial release. LiteDbBackend.Create/CreateAsync with LiteDbRepositorySettings.ForInMemory/ForFile/ForDatabase; lossless value encoding; push-down of comparisons, null checks and IN to LiteDB indexes; transactions across await; QueryPlanned/LastQueryPlan; Clear/ClearAsync, GetStoredRows; Native AOT verified (.NET 9+ in CI); passes the full conformance kit.",
